  data: {
    LLM: "Phase one: only two players play to each trick. Player to dealer's left begins with the next player clockwise; higher card wins. If the leader wins, the same two continue; if the second player wins, they start with the next player. Phase two: single cards only. Play a card that beats the previous (suit rank Spades > Hearts > Diamonds > Clubs) or pick up the previous card; then the next player leads. Last player holding cards loses.",
    Player: "Phase one: only two players play to each trick. Player to dealer's left begins with the next player clockwise; higher card wins. If the leader wins, the same two continue; if the second player wins, they start with the next player. Phase two: single cards only. Play a card that beats the previous (suit rank Spades > Hearts > Diamonds > Clubs) or pick up the previous card; then the next player leads. Last player holding cards loses.",
